    "detailed_description": "In Prehistoric Hunt your task is to hunt the rarest dinosaurs from a challenging primal environment. Will you be able to complete your hunting contracts or will you turn into the hunted?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/e161ea870635bea9fb1f924fc26e9124.poster.avif?t=1753036986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/e161ea870635bea9fb1f924fc26e9124.webm?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/e161ea870635bea9fb1f924fc26e9124.mp4?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DINOSAURS</h2>You can hunt a wide variety of 14 dinosaur species including Tyrannosaurus Rex, Spinosaurus, Triceratops, Pteranodon, and Utahraptor. Each of them have their own behavior and characteristics. Our species live on land, water, and air!  Beware, as the dinosaurs can hunt both you and each other.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/c67d154d2993096c6db84545d7d1fd00.poster.avif?t=1753036986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/c67d154d2993096c6db84545d7d1fd00.webm?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/c67d154d2993096c6db84545d7d1fd00.mp4?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/39f99a3e837318c46e69f14afe1e1194.poster.avif?t=1753036986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/39f99a3e837318c46e69f14afe1e1194.webm?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/39f99a3e837318c46e69f14afe1e1194.mp4?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENVIRONMENT</h2>Explore dense tropical jungles, open plains and high mountains. The weather changes dynamically. Experience a full day and night cycle. Discover new special locations. Move on foot, swim or fast travel. Find story notes to learn about the history of the island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TROPHY LODGE</h2>Build a customizable trophy lodge with multiple rooms to store your full-sized dinosaur trophies. Choose what to include from a selection of mounts, furniture and rooms.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/1865991c0bc8f8f44d7c1d2738ac4757.poster.avif?t=1753036986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/1865991c0bc8f8f44d7c1d2738ac4757.webm?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/1865991c0bc8f8f44d7c1d2738ac4757.mp4?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TROPHY SHOTS</h2>Take trophy shots with your catch and store memories from your hunting trips.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/24f1fbae7d17eab5a1857fb9b5c626f5.poster.avif?t=1753036986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/24f1fbae7d17eab5a1857fb9b5c626f5.webm?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/24f1fbae7d17eab5a1857fb9b5c626f5.mp4?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLAYER OR SOLO</h2>Play solo or multiplayer with up to 12 players.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/bf035065aa32025603d8721fd5d5df31.poster.avif?t=1753036986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/bf035065aa32025603d8721fd5d5df31.webm?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/bf035065aa32025603d8721fd5d5df31.mp4?t=1753036986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WEAPONS AND HUNTING EQUIPMENT</h2>Choose from 12 different weapons including .700 double rifle, revolver, .50 cal heavy rifle and hunting bow. Utilize a vast variety of hunting utility from callers to range finder. Purchase new equipment from the shop or find new items in loot boxes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/8e36cba32a35fade3132fb862fabdcf6.avif?t=1753036986\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NOTE FROM DEVELOPER</h2>Join our great community on Discord: <br>You can influence what features will be implemented into the game. We welcome any feedback and development ideas. Thank you for your support!",
